        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: Monster Energy NASCAR Cup Series race, Virginia 529 College Savings 250\n- Places: Richmond Raceway, Richmond, Virginia\n- Organizations: Monster Energy NASCAR Cup Series, Toyota North America\n- Topics: race scheduling, sponsorship\n\nFacts:\n- A particular race is an annual Monster Energy NASCAR Cup Series stock car race held at Richmond Raceway in Richmond, Virginia.\n- The race is the second of two spring races held at Richmond Raceway.\n- The first of those two spring races was sponsored from 2007 to 2011 by a brand owned by Toyota North America.\n- The Virginia 529 College Savings 250 takes place at Richmond Raceway on the day before the race.",
